Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:05.479
An hilarious Edna and Jack-Jack scene and
a return to Syndrome's island are just some

00:00:05.479 --> 00:00:08.790
of the scenes and stories that ended up cut
from Incredibles 2.

00:00:08.790 --> 00:00:13.010
Yippee-ki-yay, movie lovers, it's Jan here
and today I'm revealing all the deleted scenes

00:00:13.010 --> 00:00:15.930
and stories you never got to see in the Incredibles
sequel.

